---
import Video from './Video.astro';
---
<section class="section" id="steps" style="--hm: 2" aria-labelledby="steps-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="steps-h" data-rise>Start in 3 steps</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid steps-grid">
      <article class="card card--row span-4">
        <span class="step-num">1</span>
        <h3>Open your host’s link</h3>
        <p>Your host sends a link in the group chat. Open it and make your account.</p>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="stage stage--fade-b">
            <div class="at-rise fit step-frag">
              <div class="ui ui-pn pn-card invite" data-app data-ly-steps="700" aria-hidden="true">
                <img loading="lazy" class="invite__more" src="/brand/logo-mark.svg" alt="" width="36" height="36" />
                <h3>Join Friday table</h3>
                <p class="pn-muted">Hana invited you · 6 players</p>
                <span class="pn-label">Username</span><span class="pn-field"><span data-step>carlo.r</span></span>
                <span class="pn-label invite__more">Password</span><span class="pn-field invite__more"><span data-step>••••••••••</span></span>
                <span class="pn-btn is-primary is-block invite__more" data-step>Create account and join</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--row span-4">
        <span class="step-num">2</span>
        <h3>Put it on your phone</h3>
        <p>iPhone: Share, then Add to Home Screen. Android: the menu, then Install app.</p>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="stage stage--fade-b">
            <div class="at-rise fit step-frag">
              <div class="ui ui-pn pn-card install" data-app aria-hidden="true">
                <h3>Put PokerNights on your phone</h3>
                <p class="pn-muted">It opens like an app, with no address bar.</p>
                <ol class="install-steps">
                  <li><strong>iPhone</strong><span>In Safari, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen.</span></li>
                  <li><strong>Android</strong><span>In Chrome, open the menu, then Install app.</span></li>
                  <li><strong>From Messenger or Viber</strong><span>Open the link in your browser first.</span></li>
                </ol>
                <span class="pn-btn is-block">Got it</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--row span-4">
        <span class="step-num">3</span>
        <h3>Log every buy-in</h3>
        <p>The host taps Rebuy. Every phone at the table sees it in about five seconds.</p>
        <div class="panel panel--clip">
          <Video name="deal" class="step-clip" label="PokerNights on a phone: the Rebuy sheet for Carlo, then the pot rises from ₱6,000 to ₱7,000." />
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
